cmd-persistencesave-desc = Saves the whole world to the world save file. With a map id, saves just that map to a file instead.
cmd-persistencesave-usage = persistencesave [mapId] [filePath - default: game.map (CCVar) ]
cmd-persistencesave-no-path = filePath was not specified and CCVar {$cvar} is not set. Manually set the filePath param in order to save the map.
cmd-persistencesave-world-disabled = World persistence is disabled. Set {$cvar} to true to enable it.
cmd-persistencesave-world-no-round = There is no round in progress, so there is no world to save.
cmd-persistencesave-world-success = World saved to {$path}.
cmd-persistencesave-world-failed = Failed to save the world. Check the server log for details.

temp-playerfix-ghost-role-description = The body of {$name}, restored from the world save. Whoever played them can take it back.
